## 3. Open Questions for the User

> [!IMPORTANT]
> Please review these questions and provide your feedback:
> 1. **Expenses Categorization**: Are there other expense accounts in your Tally system that you want us to look for in the `Accounts` nature and group together in the OPEX section?
> 2. **Capital Expenditures**: Should capital outflows (like `Construction` and `New Godown`) be shown as part of the operating P&L, or kept in a separate "Capital Expenditures" section?
> 3. **Exporting Capabilities**: Do you need the ability to export this P&L and Buyer/Supplier audits directly to Excel or PDF?

---

## 4. Proposed Changes

We will create a new backend module `stats_report.py` to handle the calculations and update `index.html` to add the beautiful reporting interface.

### [NEW] [stats_report.py](file:///c:/Rice%20Mill%20Dashboard/Rice%20Mill%20Dashboard/App/stats_report.py)
Provides calculations for Reconstructed P&L, Banking Flows, DSO/DPO, and Supplier Audits.

### [MODIFY] [app.py](file:///c:/Rice%20Mill%20Dashboard/Rice%20Mill%20Dashboard/App/app.py)
Register API endpoints `/api/reports/profit-loss`, `/api/reports/cash-flow`, and `/api/reports/aging`.

### [MODIFY] [index.html](file:///c:/Rice%20Mill%20Dashboard/Rice%20Mill%20Dashboard/App/templates/index.html)
Add the "BI Reports" layout tab containing interactive tables, cash flow charts, and metrics cards.

